  command: for f in chat-text chat-stream-text chat-stream-tool-call chat-tool-result-followup chat-image chat-run-failed chat-stream-run-failed chat-rate-limit chat-auth-401 chat-empty-reply chat-stream-ended-without-output; do test -f fixtures/$f.json || exit 1; done
